[{"id":"d51e256","elType":"container","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"a2b7f14","elType":"widget","settings":{"shortcode":"[elementor-template id=3639]"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"shortcode"},{"id":"a687cc0","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='et et-hero et-hero-s'><picture><source media='(max-width:700px)' srcset='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/5ebbd586ece4c_midelt-ville-pomme-atlas-climat-histoire-infos-tourisme-maroc-1-1-600x667.webp'><img src='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/5ebbd586ece4c_midelt-ville-pomme-atlas-climat-histoire-infos-tourisme-maroc-1-1.webp' alt='' fetchpriority='high' decoding='async' data-o='https://epictravelmorocco.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/5ebbd586ece4c_midelt-ville-pomme-atlas-climat-histoire-infos-tourisme-maroc-1-1.webp' onerror=etF(this)></picture><span class='et-arch-o'></span><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-crumb'><a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/'>Home</a> / <a href='https://epictravelmorocco.com/destination/'>Tours</a> / Epic Morocco Explorer Tour</div><span class='et-eye'>Grand tour · 12 days</span><h1>Epic Morocco Explorer Tour</h1><p class='lead'>Experience Morocco’s imperial cities, deserts, mountains, and coastal towns on this immersive 12-day adventure with Epic Travel Morocco.</p><div class='et-ctas'><a class='et-btn' href='#et-iti'>See the day-by-day plan <svg aria-hidden='true' width='16' height='16'><use href='#et-i-arrow'/></svg></a><a class='et-btn et-btn-w et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Epic%20Morocco%20Explorer%20Tour%20(12%20days).%20' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-wa'/></svg>Book on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section><div class='et'><div class='et-wrap'><div class='et-facts'><div><b>12 days</b><span>11 nights</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>starting point</span></div><div><b>Casablanca</b><span>end of the tour</span></div><div><b>Private</b><span>your own driver &amp; vehicle</span></div></div></div></div><section class='et et-sec' id='et-iti'><div class='et-wrap et-tour'><div><h3 style='font-size:20px'>Route</h3><div class='et-stops'><span>Casablanca</span><span>Rabat</span><span>Chefchaouen</span><span>Volubilis</span><span>Meknes</span><span>Fes</span><span>Ifrane</span><span>Midelt</span><span>Merzouga</span><span>Todra Gorge</span><span>Dades Valley</span><span>Ouarzazate</span><span>Ait Benhaddou</span><span>Marrakech</span></div><div class='et-iti-h'><div><span class='et-eye'>Itinerary</span><h2>Day by day</h2></div><button type='button' class='et-tog' data-o='0'>Open all days</button></div><div class='et-iti'><details class='et-day et-rv' open><summary><span class='et-node'>1</span><small>Day 1</small><b>Casablanca · Rabat</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Arrival in Casablanca. Visit Hassan II Mosque (largest in Africa) if time permits. Drive to Rabat, Morocco’s capital, to explore Hassan Tower, Chellah, and Oudaya Kasbah. Overnight in Rabat.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>2</span><small>Day 2</small><b>Rabat · Ouazzane · Chefchaouen</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive to Chefchaouen via Ouazzane, passing through the fertile Gharb plain. Explore Rabat first: Oudayas Kasbah, Hassan Tower, and Mohammed V Mausoleum. Arrive in Chefchaouen in late afternoon.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>3</span><small>Day 3</small><b>Full-day exploring Chefchaouen</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Explore Chefchaouen’s blue-painted streets, Utta Hammam Square, Kasbah & Museum, and Ras El-Ma Spring. Experience local life and take photos in this picturesque medina.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>4</span><small>Day 4</small><b>Chefchaouen · Volubilis · Meknes · Fes</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive through Rif Mountains to Volubilis Roman Ruins. Continue to Meknes to see Bab Mansour Gate, olive markets, royal granaries, and stables. Arrive in Fes in the evening.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>5</span><small>Day 5</small><b>Explore Fes half day · Ifrane · Midelt</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Morning guided tour of Fes El-Bali, Royal Palaces, and Mellah. Visit Kairaouine University and explore the old medina streets. Drive south via Ifrane and cedar forest with Barbary Apes to Midelt.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>6</span><small>Day 6</small><b>Midelt · Ziz Valley · Erfoud · Merzouga Desert</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Drive through High & Middle Atlas Mountains, stop at Ziz Valley. Arrive at Erg Chebbi sand dunes, enjoy camel ride and sunset. Overnight in desert camp under the stars.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>7</span><small>Day 7</small><b>Merzouga Desert · Toudgha Gorge · Dades Valley</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Sunrise atop dunes, breakfast, then drive to Dades Valley via Erfoud and Toudgha Gorge. Explore palm oasis and scenic views. Overnight in Dades Valley.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>8</span><small>Day 8</small><b>Dades Valley · Nomad Caves · Skoura · Ouarzazate</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Visit a nomad family living in caves, explore Boutaghrar Village and Valley of Roses, arrive in Ouarzazate through Skoura palm oasis.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>9</span><small>Day 9</small><b>Ouarzazate · Ait Benhaddou · Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Breakfast, then drive through High Atlas Mountains. Visit UNESCO-listed Ait Benhaddou Kasbahs, continue to Marrakech via Tizi N’Tichka Pass (2260m), admiring Berber villages.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>10</span><small>Day 10</small><b>Full-day exploring Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Private guided tour of Marrakech: Ville Nouvelle, Majorelle Gardens, Saadian Tombs, Bahia Palace, Mellah, Souks, ending at Jamaa El-Fena Square.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>11</span><small>Day 11</small><b>Free day in Marrakech</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Day at leisure. Optional spa treatment, stroll in Medina, or evening visit to Jamaa El-Fena carnival with musicians, snake charmers, and Moroccan delicacies.</p></div></details><details class='et-day et-rv'><summary><span class='et-node'>12</span><small>Day 12</small><b>Marrakech · Casablanca</b></summary><div class='et-day-b'><p>Transfer to Casablanca airport 2–3 hours before your flight. End of 12-day Epic Morocco Explorer Tour with Epic Travel Morocco.</p></div></details></div><div class='et-note'><svg aria-hidden='true'><use href='#et-i-info'/></svg><div><b>Tailor-made:</b> Every itinerary can be adapted — start date, number of days, hotels and stops. Tell us your dates and we send you a detailed quote.</div></div></div><aside class='et-side'><div class='et-book'><div class='et-book-h et-dark'><h3>Book this tour</h3><p>Free quote within 24 hours — no payment to ask.</p></div><ul><li><span>Duration</span><b>12 days / 11 nights</b></li><li><span>Start</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>End</span><b>Casablanca</b></li><li><span>Style</span><b>Grand tour</b></li><li><span>Type</span><b>Private tour</b></li></ul><div class='et-book-f'><a class='et-btn et-btn-wa' href='https://wa.me/212661292596?text=Hello%20Epic%20Travel%20Morocco,%20